{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game looks simple, but it's ruthless on the inside. Tricky mechanics are waiting to catch you, and one wrong move could send you straight back to the bottom! But don't worry, you can try as many times as you want, <strong>so get stronger (mentally) each time you fall!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The feeling of despairing over your mistakes, yet gradually improving, is incredibly addictive. If that's you, then <strong>you're definitely a special person!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542790/extras/06.png?t=1744958308\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And just when you think climbing is all there is, you\u2019re in for an even more hellish... no, ultimate stage! Whether you\u2019ll reach it depends on your skill! If you've made it this far, don\u2019t run away now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge again and again, fall again and again, and in the end, laugh! &quot;Riseon&quot; \u2013 Are you ready to take on this challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The ultra-tough jumping action is here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542790/extras/08.png?t=1744958308\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3542790?t=1744958308","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542790/d2b414afa414f85a192aa1c36ad04e6c5c027840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744958308","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542790/354c79d7b715c71b797be00b6887ea67b3dbe045/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744958308","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542790/354c79d7b715c71b797be00b6887ea67b3dbe045/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744958308","categor